#: src/borrowing/interior-mutability/cell.md:19
msgid "// Note that `cell` is NOT declared as mutable.\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/borrowing/interior-mutability/cell.md:29
msgid ""
"`Cell` is a simple means to ensure safety: it has a `set` method that takes "
"`&self`. This needs no runtime check, but requires moving values, which can "
"have its own cost."
msgstr ""
